@* #350: what a degraded page tells its operator: why the application is degraded, and the repair they
   can run from where they are. Renders nothing while the database is healthy, so a page can include it
   unconditionally. The reason comes from in-memory state, never from the database, whose content is
   untrusted for as long as this banner shows at all. *@
@if (!DatabaseHealth.IsHealthy)
{
    <div class="alert alert-warning" role="alert">
        <p class="mb-2">@FailureReason</p>
        <DatabaseRepairActions />
    </div>
}
